/*
 * The cylindrical face has an exact C-E-C keyhole excursion made from
 * distinct edges #43/#44.  Each edge has its reciprocal use on one of the
 * two adjacent faces of the tetrahedral component.  Face-local normalization
 * removes the zero-area excursion; whole-shell processing must then rejoin
 * the two remaining uses using authoritative endpoint and curve-locus proof.
